// DECEMBER 10 — TIME LOOP 1
// First playable repeat of December 10. Existing scene5.yarn remains untouched.
// One arrival node per room selects the right beat from $loop1_stage.
// The player controls Anin for the calendar, getting dressed, sitting with Kirana,
// finding Dira, finding Lila, and leaving the Cafeteria for fresh air.
// Set $chapter_scene to 11 during the preceding calendar reset. Bind the
// Story_Loop1 objects, arrival nodes, interactables, actors, and exits in Unity.
// Dorm uses the existing wake-up pose and the imported normal calendar art.
// The Locker Room memory revisits Lila's original line in the Classroom.
// ENDING TODO: Cutscene_FalFall is reused unchanged; its text and frame order are being reworked.
// ADD CutsceneCanvas to PhotographyClub for the centered black narration.

title: Loop1_Declarations
tags: setup testing
---
// Never start this node. These values track this loop across room loads.
<<declare $loop1_calendar_checked = false>>
<<declare $loop1_dressed = false>>
<<declare $loop1_stage = "dorm">>
<<declare $loop1_myth_flashback = false>>
<<declare $loop1_students_left = false>>
<<declare $loop1_asked_lila_about_dira = false>>
===

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// DORM — ANIN RECOGNIZES THE REPEATED MORNING
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------

title: Loop1_Dorm_Morning
tags: december10 loop1 dorm morning testing
---
<<set $loop1_calendar_checked to false>>
<<set $loop1_dressed to false>>
<<set $anin_dressed to false>>
<<set $loop1_stage to "dorm">>
<<set $loop1_students_left to false>>
<<set $dec9_classroom_phase to "loop1">>
<<set $story_exit to true>>
// The existing Dorm wake-up sequence plays before this node.
Kirana: Morning! You ready for our last day?
Anin: Ready or not, it'll be our last day anyway.
Kirana: Hey, at least we still have today.
Anin: Okay... (I don't get what she means.)
Kirana: I'm heading out. See you at school!
Anin: Wait, Kirana, why are you...
<<close_dialogue_bubble>>
<<door_exit "Kirana" "Dorm">>
Anin: ...not wearing our graduation clothes?
Anin: (This is definitely weird.)
Anin: Wait... why is the calendar...
<<quest_start "loop1" "Check the calendar">>
// CONTROL ANIN. Calendar interaction: Loop1_Dorm_Calendar.
===

title: Loop1_Dorm_Calendar
tags: december10 loop1 dorm interactable testing
---
<<if $loop1_calendar_checked is false>>
    Anin: I circled December 10 yesterday, right? Why has it...
    <<story_splash "calendar_normal">>
    Anin: ...disappeared?
    <<story_splash_end>>
    Anin: I need to confirm something.
    <<set $loop1_calendar_checked to true>>
    <<quest_update "loop1" "Get dressed and go to school">>
<<else>>
    <<story_splash "calendar_normal">>
    Anin: Why did the circle I drew disappear?
    <<story_splash_end>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Loop1_Dorm_Desk
tags: december10 loop1 dorm interactable testing
---
<<if $loop1_calendar_checked is false>>
    Anin: I need to check the calendar first.
<<elseif $loop1_dressed is false>>
    Anin: I should get ready.
    -> Get dressed
        <<set $loop1_dressed to true>>
        <<set $anin_dressed to true>>
        <<fade_outfit "Anin" "uniform">>
    -> Not yet
        <<stop>>
<<else>>
    Anin: I'm already wearing my uniform.
<<endif>>
===

title: Loop1_Dorm_Door
tags: december10 loop1 dorm exit testing
---
<<if $loop1_calendar_checked is false>>
    Anin: I need to check the calendar first.
<<elseif $loop1_dressed is false>>
    Anin: I should get dressed first.
<<else>>
    <<set $loop1_stage to "lockers">>
    <<set $story_exit to false>>
    <<quest_hide_objective "loop1">>
    <<scene_transition "LockerRoom" "door">>
<<endif>>
===

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// LOCKER ROOM — THE REPEATED CONVERSATION
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------

title: Loop1_Lockers_Entry
tags: december10 loop1 lockers entry testing
---
<<if $loop1_stage == "lockers">>
    // Student A and Student B are clearing their lockers. They exit right.
    Student A: You're still not done clearing your locker?
    Student B: I just found my first-year ID photo!
    Student A: Oh, that haircut...
    Student B: Don't. I've suffered enough.
    <<close_dialogue_bubble>>
    <<fade_black_out>>
    <<set $loop1_students_left to true>>
    <<hide "StudentALoop1">>
    <<hide "StudentBLoop1">>
    <<fade_black_in>>
    Anin: I knew it...
    // Revisit the real Classroom so Lila says the line herself.
    <<fade_black_out>>
    <<memory_montage true>>
    <<set $loop1_myth_flashback to true>>
    <<replay_cutscene "Dec9_Classroom_Arrival">>
    <<set $chapter_scene to 9>>
    <<set_time_of_day "morning">>
    <<scene_transition_at_x "Classroom" 7.29 "right">>
<<elseif $loop1_stage == "lockers_after_myth">>
    <<jump Loop1_Lockers_AfterMyth>>
<<elseif $loop1_stage == "fresh_air">>
    <<jump Loop1_Lockers_Night>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Loop1_Lockers_AfterMyth
tags: december10 loop1 lockers flashback return testing
---
    Anin: It really is happening...
    Anin: Wait... does that mean I get another day with everyone?
    <<close_dialogue_bubble>>
    <<delay 2>>
    Anin: Okay, calm down... breathe in... breathe out...
    Anin: WOOHOO!!!
    Anin: I-I need to make the most of this. I might not get another chance...
    Anin: Okay, here goes nothing. Let's start with Kirana.
    Anin: I remember her being at the cafeteria all day yesterday.
    <<set $loop1_stage to "find_kirana">>
    <<quest_update "loop1" "Find Kirana at the cafeteria">>
    // CONTROL ANIN. Use the map exit to reach the Cafeteria.
===

title: Loop1_Lockers_DormExit
tags: december10 loop1 lockers exit testing
---
Anin: I can't go back now.
===

title: Loop1_Lockers_RooftopExit
tags: december10 loop1 lockers exit testing
---
Anin: I need to find the others first.
===

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// CAFETERIA — ANIN TRIES TO RECREATE A HAPPY DAY
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------

title: Loop1_Cafeteria_Entry
tags: december10 loop1 cafeteria entry testing
---
<<if $loop1_stage == "find_kirana">>
    // SchoolMap plays the Morning-to-Lunch clock transition instead of its black room fade.
    // Keep direct Playtest Start entries in sync when they bypass SchoolMap.
    <<set_time_of_day "lunch">>
    Anin: Okay. If I sit at our usual table, Kirana will come over, just like yesterday.
    <<quest_update "loop1" "Sit at the usual table">>
    // CONTROL ANIN. Table interaction: Loop1_Cafeteria_Table.
<<elseif $loop1_stage == "after_school">>
    <<jump Loop1_Cafeteria_AfterSchool>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Loop1_Cafeteria_Table
tags: december10 loop1 cafeteria interactable testing
---
<<if $loop1_stage == "find_kirana">>
    Anin: Here goes nothing.
    <<close_dialogue_bubble>>
    <<fade_black_out>>
    <<sit "Anin">>
    <<fade_black_in>>
    // Kirana approaches after Anin sits. Tune the offset with the table layout.
    <<show "KiranaSceneLoop1">>
    <<stand "KiranaSceneLoop1">>
    <<move_character_to_actor "KiranaSceneLoop1" "Anin" -2.5 6 "walk">>
    Kirana: Hey! Same table?
    <<face_character "Anin" "left">>
    Anin: (Wow. It really happened.) As always.
    Kirana: When I move, I'll find us a table just...
    <<stand "Anin">>
    <<face_character "Anin" "left">>
    Anin: Hey, Kirana, let's take a photo together. All of us.
    Kirana: What? Why so sudden?
    Anin: Come on. Graduation's tomorrow. This is our last normal school day.
    Anin: Okay? Let's go to Photography Club. Now!
    Kirana: Okay, okay. It's rare to see you this excited, Anin.
    Kirana: Let's go together?
    Anin: Nah, you go ahead. I'll grab everyone.
    Kirana: Okay, then. Don't keep me waiting long.
    <<close_dialogue_bubble>>
    <<move_character "KiranaSceneLoop1" -29.15 6 "walk">>
    <<hide "KiranaSceneLoop1">>
    Anin: Okay, next up: Dira in the Auditorium.
    <<set $loop1_stage to "find_dira">>
    <<quest_update "loop1" "Find Dira at the auditorium">>
    // CONTROL ANIN. Leave through the map exit.
<<endif>>
===

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// AUDITORIUM AND LIBRARY — DIRA IS SOMEWHERE ELSE THIS LOOP
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------

title: Loop1_Auditorium_Entry
tags: december10 loop1 auditorium entry testing
---
<<if $loop1_stage == "find_dira">>
    // Dira's previous spot was X -44.98. Anin walks to its +2.5 offset,
    // beginning while the room's black entry fade is still opening.
    <<place_character_near_x "Anin" -42.48 8>>
    <<delay 0.75>>
    <<move_character "Anin" -42.48 4 "walk">>
    Anin: Diraa! Let's go take a photo togeth...
    Anin: Wait...
    Anin: Why isn't she here?
    Anin: Calm down, Anin. I just need to look for her.
    Anin: Let's start somewhere Dira would actually like.
    <<set $loop1_stage to "search_dira">>
    <<quest_update "loop1" "Find Dira">>
    // CONTROL ANIN. Dira interaction is in the Library.
<<endif>>
===

title: Loop1_Library_Dira
tags: december10 loop1 library interactable testing
---
<<if $loop1_stage == "search_dira">>
    Anin: Here you are...
    Dira: Hey, Anin. It's rare to see you here. Need something?
    Anin: Yup. As a matter of fact, I do.
    Anin: Let's take a group photo. All of us.
    Dira: Like, right now?
    Anin: Exactly. Right this second.
    Anin: Or else...
    Dira: Or else?
    Anin: No free lunch for you.
    Dira: Wait, what happened? Why are you suddenly so generous?
    Anin: You wound me. I can be nice once in a while, you know.
    Dira: Hehe, of course you can. Where should we take it?
    Anin: Photography Club. Kirana's already waiting. I'm gonna grab Lila real quick.
    Dira: Okay. Anything for a free lunch.
    <<close_dialogue_bubble>>
    <<door_exit "DiraSceneLoop1" "Library">>
    Anin: One more to go. Dira wasn't where she was yesterday, so Lila might not be at Photography Club either.
    <<set $loop1_stage to "find_lila">>
    <<quest_update "loop1" "Find Lila">>
    // CONTROL ANIN. Find Lila in the Music Room.
<<endif>>
===

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// MUSIC ROOM → PHOTOGRAPHY CLUB → AFTER-SCHOOL CAFETERIA
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------

title: Loop1_Music_Entry
tags: december10 loop1 musicroom entry testing
---
<<if $loop1_stage == "search_dira" and $loop1_asked_lila_about_dira is false>>
    Anin: Lila, have you seen Dira?
    Lila: Not since this morning. I was about to head back to the Dorm.
    Anin: Wait. I still want a photo with everyone. Don't go home yet.
    Lila: Okay, okay. I'll stay until we get that photo.
    <<set $loop1_asked_lila_about_dira to true>>
<<elseif $loop1_stage == "find_lila">>
    Anin: Morning, dummy.
    Lila: What? Who said tha...
    Lila: Oh, it's just Anin. What's up?
    Anin: Nothing. Just felt like playing some guitar today.
    Lila: Wait, we've known each other for three years and you're only now telling me you play guitar?
    Anin: Nope. Who said I could play?
    Lila: HEY!
    Anin: So loud...
    Lila: So, why are you here? Miss me or something?
    Anin: Oops, almost forgot. Let's go to Photography Club, Lila.
    Lila: Why? Don't tell me you want me to take photos of you and some guy from ano...
    Anin: NO! Us girls. No boys allowed!
    Lila: Ah, bummer. Well, any excuse to put my photography skills to use.
    Anin: Yup. Your skill at making every photo blurry or cutting someone's head off.
    Lila: HEY! STOP REMEMBERING THAT!
    <<set $loop1_stage to "photo_montage">>
    <<scene_transition "PhotographyClub">>
<<endif>>
===

title: Loop1_Photography_Entry
tags: december10 loop1 photographyclub entry testing
---
<<if $loop1_stage == "search_dira">>
    <<show "Kirana">>
    // Kirana waits here while Anin searches for Dira.
<<elseif $loop1_stage == "find_lila">>
    <<show "Kirana">>
    // Kirana remains here while Anin searches for Lila.
<<elseif $loop1_stage == "photo_montage">>
    // The room opens directly onto a black screen with text centered in it.
    // The player taps once per line. No dialogue bubble appears here.
    <<cutscene_black>>
    Afterward, they took far too many photos together in the Photography Club room.
    At lunchtime, Anin treated everyone to a meal at the cafeteria.
    The others were, to put it mildly, very happy about it.
    <<set $loop1_stage to "after_school">>
    // Keep the black panel up until the room changes, avoiding a flash of the room.
    <<advance_time_to_scene "after_school" "Cafeteria">>
<<endif>>
===

title: Loop1_Photography_Kirana
tags: december10 loop1 photographyclub interactable testing
---
<<if $loop1_stage == "search_dira">>
    Anin: Kirana, have you seen Dira?
    Kirana: Not yet. I'll wait here while you look for her.
<<elseif $loop1_stage == "find_lila">>
    Kirana: Any sign of Lila? I'll stay here for the photo.
<<endif>>
===

title: Loop1_Cafeteria_AfterSchool
tags: december10 loop1 cafeteria afterschool testing
---
// The friends stand near the door, ready to leave.
<<show "KiranaSceneLoop1">>
<<stand "KiranaSceneLoop1">>
Dira: Hey, Anin. You seem happier today.
Anin: Hmm, do I?
Lila: Now that you mention it, she does seem pretty chipper.
Kirana: Yeah, we were worried about you. But after today, maybe we were overthinking it.
Anin: Oh... did I look sad to you guys?
Lila: Not sad. It's just...
Dira: ...like something's been worrying you.
Dira: Is it about the future, Anin?
Anin: !?
Kirana: Now that I think about it, you still haven't decided what to do after gradu...
Anin: ...stop it...
Dira: Anin?
Anin: Ah... I think I forgot something at Photography Club. You guys go ahead. I'll see you tomorrow.
Kirana: ...
Kirana: Okay. Take care, Anin.
Dira: R-right. Don't stay too late, okay?
Lila: See you tomorrow, Anin!
// The friends leave Anin alone by the door.
<<hide "KiranaSceneLoop1">>
<<hide "DiraSceneLoop1">>
<<hide "LilaSceneLoop1">>
Anin: ...
<<delay 2>>
Anin: I need some fresh air...
<<set $loop1_stage to "fresh_air">>
<<quest_update "loop1" "Get some fresh air">>
// CONTROL ANIN. Cafeteria map exit runs Loop1_Cafeteria_Exit.
===

title: Loop1_Cafeteria_Exit
tags: december10 loop1 cafeteria exit testing
---
<<if $loop1_stage == "fresh_air">>
    <<advance_time_to_scene "night" "LockerRoom">>
<<elseif $loop1_stage == "find_kirana">>
    Anin: I should sit at our table first.
<<else>>
    <<scene_transition "SchoolMap">>
<<endif>>
===

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// LOCKER ROOM AT NIGHT — FAL'S DEATH / EXHIBITION END
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------

title: Loop1_Lockers_Night
tags: december10 loop1 lockers night ending testing
---
Anin: ...
Anin: Why did they have to bring up the future? Now my whole mood's ruined.
Anin: It's like nobody here understands me. What's so bad about living in the moment?
Anin: Nobody?
Anin: Is it really nobody?
Anin: Wait...
Anin: Why do I feel like I'm forgetting something important?
// Existing Fal death cutscene is a temporary reuse. Its text and frames will be revised.
<<detour Cutscene_FalFall>>
// Cut directly from its final image to a black thank-you card.
<<cutscene_black>>
Thank you for playing.
// The player taps the card before the Title Screen loads.
<<scene_transition "TitleScreen">>
===
